 "Arts martiaux : dé et Dextérité automatiques": "Martial Arts: automatic die and Dexterity",
 "<strong>Métabolisme surnaturel</strong> : {0} point(s) de focus récupéré(s), {1} PV rendus ({2}).": "<strong>Uncanny Metabolism</strong>: {0} Focus Point(s) regained, {1} HP restored ({2}).",
